      "message": "Just to make sure - you\u0027re suggesting I only apply the scaling on the minimal set of timeouts to make this work? If so, ack, I can go figure this out.\n\nOn the off chance you mean that we need to find out what\u0027s taking so long and shorten the timeout, unfortunately I doubt that\u0027ll be possible here, the particular test I\u0027m running is on an riscv64 image on an ARM server - the cross-arch makes things incredibly slow and there\u0027s no easy way to get it to run faster.\n\nAssuming you mean the former, I\u0027ll start verifying the minimal set now.",
